      <article class="card"><h3><a href="/examples/refund-verification/">Retail refund</a></h3><p>Settlement is the goal. Acceptance is not.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3><a href="/examples/insurance-claims/">Insurance claims</a></h3><p>Human approval. Stale policy versions cannot authorize payout.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3><a href="https://github.com/goshikavs/goshikq-agent-framework/tree/main/examples/multi-agent-refund">Multi-agent refund</a></h3><p>Supervisor plus children. Child completion is not parent verification.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Marketing>
